From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: opi5 <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] media: rockchip: mpp: add KUnit tests

mpp_kunit (ROCKCHIP_MPP_KUNIT_TEST) checks what the earlier patches rely on,
with literal values rather than the driver's macros:

- mpp_uapi: struct mpp_request (24 bytes) and its offsets, MPP_IOC_CFG_V1
  (0x40047601), the command values and flags of rk-mpp.h (1010).
- mpp_cmd: mpp_check_cmd_v1 accepts each group's commands from BASE to
  BUTT - 1 and nothing else, for every command below 0x1000 and some above.
- mpp_check_req: in range, below the base, at and past the end, straddling
  the end (cut to what fits) and offset + size wrapping a u32 (4010).
- rkvdec2_ccu_timeout: the thresholds at the 1080p and 4K boundaries and
  8K, 0x59fffff from 4K (3010).

mpp_check_cmd_v1 and rkvdec2_ccu_get_timeout_threshold are static unless
CONFIG_KUNIT is on; then they and mpp_check_req are exported in the
EXPORTED_FOR_KUNIT_TESTING namespace.
---
 drivers/media/platform/rockchip/mpp/Kconfig   |  11 +
 drivers/media/platform/rockchip/mpp/Makefile  |   1 +
 .../media/platform/rockchip/mpp/mpp_common.c  |   5 +-
 .../media/platform/rockchip/mpp/mpp_common.h  |   4 +
 .../media/platform/rockchip/mpp/mpp_kunit.c   | 234 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../platform/rockchip/mpp/mpp_rkvdec2_link.c  |   4 +-
 .../platform/rockchip/mpp/mpp_rkvdec2_link.h  |   5 +
 7 files changed, 262 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 drivers/media/platform/rockchip/mpp/mpp_kunit.c

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/rockchip/mpp/Kconfig b/drivers/media/platform/rockchip/mpp/Kconfig
index 262480802299..d53f12ce1f02 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/rockchip/mpp/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/rockchip/mpp/Kconfig
@@ -29,4 +29,15 @@ config ROCKCHIP_MPP_RKVENC2
 	help
 	  Bind both RK3588 RKVENC2 cores through the MPP request ABI.
 
+config ROCKCHIP_MPP_KUNIT_TEST
+	tristate "KUnit tests for the MPP service" if !KUNIT_ALL_TESTS
+	depends on KUNIT
+	default KUNIT_ALL_TESTS
+	help
+	  Tests for the request ABI, the ioctl command filter, the register
+	  request bounds and, with ROCKCHIP_MPP_RKVDEC2, the CCU timeout, as
+	  the mpp_kunit module. Loading it runs them and taints the kernel.
+	  With KUNIT on, the functions under test are exported in the
+	  EXPORTED_FOR_KUNIT_TESTING namespace.
+
 endif
